            "value": "WindowShade can't update from the menu on this Mac. Download the new version and drag it into Applications to replace the old one."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台 Mac 上没法在菜单里更新 WindowShade。到下载页下载新版，拖进“应用程序”文件夹替换原来那一份。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這台 Mac 上沒法在選單裡更新 WindowShade。到下載頁下載新版，拖進“應用程式”資料夾取代原來那一份。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
